WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.744 --> 00:00:04.645
(gypsy music)

00:00:06.756 --> 00:00:08.898
- [Voiceover] Did she just
make full eye contact?

00:00:09.882 --> 00:00:11.074
Definitely no one behind me.

00:00:12.458 --> 00:00:13.832
- Want a free sample?

00:00:13.832 --> 00:00:14.853
- Hey.

00:00:19.052 --> 00:00:21.426
BuzzFeed presents Is She Flirting?

00:00:21.426 --> 00:00:23.726
Or Just Being Nice?

00:00:23.726 --> 00:00:24.796
- Do you like to cook?

00:00:24.796 --> 00:00:25.903
- I, yeah, I love it.

00:00:25.903 --> 00:00:28.410
- They go great on pies or on salads,

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:30.071
and they're gluten free.

00:00:30.071 --> 00:00:31.707
- I didn't know that.

00:00:31.707 --> 00:00:32.775
- [Voiceover] Huh. Sounds like she's

00:00:32.775 --> 00:00:34.763
taking an interest in my personal life.

00:00:34.763 --> 00:00:36.304
- Well, do you live with anyone?

00:00:36.304 --> 00:00:37.836
Should you buy for two?

00:00:37.836 --> 00:00:39.113
- Oh, I uhh...

00:00:39.113 --> 00:00:42.527
- [Voiceover] Is she trying
to figure out if I'm single?

00:00:42.527 --> 00:00:44.846
She could just be trying
to sell me apples.

00:00:44.892 --> 00:00:46.605
- You know, has anyone ever told you

00:00:46.605 --> 00:00:48.161
you look like another person?

00:00:48.976 --> 00:00:51.380
- [Voiceover] I do look
like a relatable Matt Damon.

00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:54.096
- Normally, I could only
give people one free sample,

00:00:54.096 --> 00:00:55.675
but you can have as many as you want.

00:00:55.675 --> 00:00:57.626
- [Voiceover] Does that
mean what I think it means?

00:00:57.626 --> 00:00:59.692
- There is a great bar just around

00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:01.503
the corner that I go to all the time.

00:01:01.503 --> 00:01:03.082
You should totally check it out.

00:01:03.082 --> 00:01:03.988
- OK, uh, when?

00:01:03.988 --> 00:01:05.565
- Whenever.

00:01:05.591 --> 00:01:06.256
- [Voiceover] Alright, I'm in.

00:01:06.256 --> 00:01:08.794
That's a clear invitation,
definitely going to ask her out.

00:01:08.794 --> 00:01:09.949
Next week.

00:01:09.949 --> 00:01:11.021
- So good to meet you Patrick.

00:01:11.021 --> 00:01:11.996
- Yeah, bye.

00:01:12.411 --> 00:01:14.619
- Peter! You came back!

00:01:14.619 --> 00:01:16.105
So good to see you!

00:01:16.105 --> 00:01:18.056
Have as many free samples as you want.

00:01:18.056 --> 00:01:18.822
- Thanks.

00:01:18.822 --> 00:01:19.822
- Did you go check out that bar?

00:01:19.822 --> 00:01:21.585
Subscribe for more wonderful things.

